Where HevenOps fits. Existing products already cover rent and occupancy. HevenOps’ proposed advantage is a specific workflow for operators who rent out beds inside leased apartments. The prototype lets an owner set up Property → Floor → Apartment → Room → Bed, track rent every 30 days from each tenant’s move-in date, and give each manager access to their assigned properties. A reason to switch would be faster vacancy checks and rent reconciliation across flats. That benefit is a hypothesis to test with operators. Online payments and WhatsApp delivery are areas where existing competitors already offer more.
